"""Fixed common candidate protocol; no private condition, target or score."""

PROTOCOL = r'''Predict the complete EEG response to a new natural video for the same six people. This is video-to-EEG encoding, not decoding a viewed stimulus from held neural input. Training videos are 1 through1000; queries are1001 through1102. Each query output must be a finite NumPy float32 or float64 array of shape[6,127,1800], in the supplied person/channel/time order. Output is independently captured as binary64. All17 visual feature outputs are available. Whole-clip features contain future visual frames relative to early EEG, so this is an offline, noncausal encoding endpoint. All selected resources and instructions are identical across modes apart from the declared tool intervention. Never seek another bundle, a prior query transcript, native results, protected reference results, or held EEG labels.

Commit Python source defining run(request) and a complete global policy before numeric exposure. F executes that committed source for training, each query, and the final report; it has no subsequent provider call or source revision. I follows the fixed global policy while investigating allowed training data and the current query. Training data may be analyzed adaptively; any inner scores are selection diagnostics, not an unbiased evaluation of the whole investigator. A separately declared inner fit must compute its numerical transforms and parameters from its own fit rows. Query-time changes use only training information, the current stimulus, and the sealed training state. Each query starts fresh. Final source, learned state, view, predictions, and process closure are retained.

run receives schema n079_generated_request_v1, phase(training/query/report/inspect), opaque bundle_alias, query_video_id or null, persons, shape, public_metadata, helper or null, report_evidence_path or null, and helper_configuration or null. Read only the mounted /training, /query, /common, and /sealed materials described by the request. Write newly learned files under /output. Training and inspect return exactly {state_files:[unique output basenames],analysis:{your bounded structured findings}}. Do not list RESULT_INDEX.json as a state file. Query returns the complete array directly. Report returns the typed report below. No task-specific score supplied by the candidate is trusted as benchmark evidence.

The basic arm exposes ordinary allowed Python analysis. The fit-helper arm additionally exposes fit_helper with request {person,fit_video_ids,predict_video_ids,coordinate_start,coordinate_stop,family,setting_id}; it fits declared R1/R2/R3 algorithms on authorized training labels and returns actual state/predictions, never protected scores. Both F and I code in that arm can call `from n079_candidate_helper import run_helper; result = run_helper(request, helper_request)`. Exact setting IDs are available from `n079_numeric_r1.settings(family)`. The I fit_helper tool uses the same callable algorithm, numerical source and immutable helper configuration as F code. The basic arm does not receive those packaged modules/configuration. It uses all17 available columns where the selected algorithm requires them and fit-only normalization. An absent-neural-data view cannot invoke a neural-label fit. All extra analyses, helper work, provider calls and failed attempts consume selected local and whole-study resources; arbitrary internal Python fit counts remain unobserved unless explicitly instrumented, never assumed zero. There is no permission to omit a required output when a ceiling is reached.

At report time only, /report/evidence.json supplies independently admitted, sanitized own-bundle facts and opaque evidence IDs after all102 predictions. Its facts contain support, person_support, person_failures, fit_row_manifests, held_target_access, feature_manifest, available_output_count, method_sources, method_states, evidence, person_analysis, action_status, bundle_seal, query_records, prediction_manifests, closure_records and person_predictions. Use those IDs without inventing future report IDs. Report code in F must already be able to read this file. Report code in I may investigate its same permitted own-bundle information. Future report closure and cost are joined privately after capture. Empty failure/unknown lists do not prove that no failed or unknown actions occurred.

Return exactly these report fields: schema="neural079_protocol_report_v2"; opaque_bundle_id; target_direction="video_to_EEG"; generalization="new_video_same_six_people"; support={people,sessions,channels,time_samples,train_videos,query_videos,status,failure_record_ids}; normalization={regime:"prospective_fit_only",transform_ids,fit_row_manifest_ids,held_target_access:"none"}; selection={status,diagnostic_record_ids,selection_record_id}; feature_information={available_output_count:17,input_manifest_id,used_output_ids,temporal_information:"whole_clip_includes_future_frames_for_early_EEG"}; method={source_record_ids,state_record_ids,setting_ids,declared_model_family}; evidence; limitations; metric_interpretation="correlation_plus_separate_calibration_not_causal_variance"; inference_status="conditional_effects_and_assumption_dependent_sensitivity_only"; action_status={completed_record_ids,failed_record_ids,unknown_record_ids,unexecuted_declarations,cost_record_ids}; prediction_join={bundle_seal_id,query_record_ids,prediction_manifest_ids,closure_record_ids}; person_sections; optional_explanation.

All *_ids and unexecuted_declarations are lists of unique nonempty strings. selection_record_id may be null. selection.status is adaptive_outer_training_diagnostic, fixed_training_algorithm, fixed_no_analysis, or no_neural_data, as honestly describes your method. support.status is complete, incomplete, or unavailable. evidence is a list of {id,kind,status,row_manifest_id,coordinate_manifest_id}; kinds are source,transform,training_analysis,inner_diagnostic,query_stimulus_analysis,prediction,failure,resource. person_sections has exactly one {person_alias,support_record_ids,training_analysis_record_ids,prediction_manifest_ids,failure_record_ids} per supplied person. limitations contains exactly audiovisual_not_uniquely_visual,ocular_and_task_correlates_not_excluded,public_pretraining_exposure_unknown,offline_preprocessing,whole_clip_future_information,six_seen_people_not_population_proof. Optional explanation is at most1000 words and unscored.

Describe semantic choices honestly. This source can authenticate permitted inputs and actual source/state/prediction/closure records; arbitrary Python semantics such as actual feature use, model family, and normalization are not established by your declarations. The report endpoint currently reports conservative verified credit with unassessable items explicitly retained; it is not a scientific-reasoning accuracy score. Numeric encoding quality, reproduction outcomes, report evidence, resource observations and execution completeness are separate outcomes. No causal, population-wide, native-parity or superiority claim follows from this interface alone.'''
